WEBVTT

01:46.880 --> 01:49.480
Traces of an anesthetic were detected
in the victim's blood.

01:50.120 --> 01:52.600
A distinct injection mark on the neck.

01:52.680 --> 01:55.240
Multiple signs of struggle on the limbs.

01:55.320 --> 01:57.280
The surface of the body
shows a cherry-red color.

01:57.360 --> 01:59.000
That's the typical sign of death
caused by hypothermia.

01:59.800 --> 02:04.320
In other words,
Mei got into a fight with someone.

02:04.400 --> 02:07.120
During the struggle,
he was injected with an anesthetic

02:07.720 --> 02:08.960
before being stuffed into the freezer.

02:10.320 --> 02:11.480
Time of death?

02:11.560 --> 02:12.560
Around four weeks ago.

02:12.640 --> 02:14.040
Four weeks ago?

02:15.200 --> 02:16.640
Only one student
went missing at that time.

02:16.720 --> 02:19.880
The other four students
weren't taken by Mei.

02:21.840 --> 02:24.200
Could he have had an accomplice?

02:24.280 --> 02:26.760
Maybe they argued over something,

02:26.840 --> 02:28.320
then the accomplice killed him

02:28.400 --> 02:30.040
and kept using the old method
to continue the crimes.

02:34.760 --> 02:39.040
JUNE 10TH, 2015, REPORT FILED

02:40.720 --> 02:41.960
At this stage of the case,

02:42.960 --> 02:44.080
there's a strong chance Mei's accomplice

02:44.160 --> 02:45.880
has taken the four children
out of Weiyang.

02:45.960 --> 02:49.080
And right now, we still have no new leads.

02:51.040 --> 02:53.320
Tomorrow is the last day
of the seven-day deadline.

02:53.920 --> 02:57.920
How about we ask Director Zou
for two more days?

03:05.760 --> 03:07.200
I made a promise.

03:08.040 --> 03:08.960
Don't be discouraged.

03:10.040 --> 03:11.280
Even if we miss the deadline,

03:11.360 --> 03:12.760
I'll take responsibility.

03:13.360 --> 03:16.080
You all keep looking for the children.
Don't stop until they're found.

03:27.000 --> 03:28.760
If only we had listened to Xiaohe earlier

03:28.840 --> 03:30.600
and focused all our manpower
on investigating Yuanlongli,

03:30.680 --> 03:33.120
maybe there would be no regrets.

03:45.760 --> 03:48.920
There's no sign at all
of Mei's accomplice or the four children.

03:49.000 --> 03:51.720
If we keep digging around this place,
does it still mean anything?

03:52.440 --> 03:56.560
No. 1316 shows no signs
of anyone living there after Mei died.

03:56.640 --> 03:58.320
But the kidnappings kept happening,

03:58.400 --> 04:00.200
using the same old method.

04:00.280 --> 04:01.840
What does that tell us?

04:06.520 --> 04:07.960
Hey, you.

04:08.520 --> 04:09.360
What is that?

04:09.440 --> 04:13.160
A strategic meeting needs to come up
with a real-time battle plan or something.

04:13.240 --> 04:15.040
Go do your thing. Stay out of the way.

04:15.800 --> 04:16.959
Alright.

04:22.680 --> 04:24.040
Where was I?

04:24.960 --> 04:26.080
What does that tell us?

04:27.480 --> 04:31.160
To snatch children away
from a crowded and exposed place

04:31.240 --> 04:35.000
suggests a hidden route.

04:39.400 --> 04:40.360
A hidden route?

04:41.040 --> 04:43.600
Captain Qu has turned
this place upside down.

04:43.680 --> 04:45.360
We're not checking
the internet café today.

04:45.440 --> 04:47.320
We're checking the ways out of it.

04:48.440 --> 04:51.520
First, check the B1 route.

04:51.600 --> 04:54.440
Second, check the garage exit route.

04:54.960 --> 04:56.840
Same method as before. Block both ends.

05:03.320 --> 05:04.600
You're not eating your instant noodles?

05:08.120 --> 05:13.840
NEW YORK BLOCK

05:16.080 --> 05:17.880
NEED GLASSES? FIND US AT OPTICAL
INSTALLMENT PLANS, CREDIT CARDS

05:22.240 --> 05:24.600
-Are you a police officer?
-Yes.

05:24.680 --> 05:26.760
Last week, I told you
my platform truck was stolen.

05:27.520 --> 05:29.320
Can you do something about it?

05:29.400 --> 05:30.960
When are you sending someone
to look into it?

05:31.600 --> 05:34.880
Mister, we're working on a case.
I'll help you find it once we're done.

05:35.760 --> 05:37.520
What did the platform truck look like?

05:38.600 --> 05:39.960
That kind. Blue in color.

05:57.400 --> 05:58.640
Mr. He, I'll do it.

05:58.720 --> 06:00.200
What's on it?

06:02.320 --> 06:04.280
Are you done? I'm about to suffocate.

06:07.440 --> 06:10.560
I get it now. The trafficker
knocked the children out,

06:10.640 --> 06:12.160
then used the platform truck
to haul them out.

06:12.240 --> 06:14.080
Search both directions.

06:14.160 --> 06:15.680
See if there are any clues.

06:15.760 --> 06:16.800
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN
GARAGE EXIT, NO ENTRY

06:16.880 --> 06:18.200
LASER ENGRAVING, CUSTOM GIFTS

06:18.280 --> 06:19.880
There should've been a car outside
waiting to pick them up.

06:19.960 --> 06:22.120
It's not likely the person
dragged the platform truck around.

06:22.200 --> 06:23.920
Most likely that's what happened.

06:24.000 --> 06:25.920
But there's still
a small chance otherwise.

06:27.400 --> 06:30.680
Mr. Ran once told me
that out of 10,000 possibilities,

06:30.760 --> 06:33.280
if you miss one, you might miss the truth.

06:35.040 --> 06:36.720
Bai, Hui. You two take this side.
I'll check over there.

06:36.800 --> 06:37.720
Okay.

06:44.880 --> 06:47.960
You can always count on Ran.

07:07.000 --> 07:07.920
Captain Ran,

07:08.000 --> 07:09.760
a case was transferred over
from Jiangwan Road Police Station.

07:09.840 --> 07:11.920
Last night, a woman
was attacked on the street.

07:12.000 --> 07:14.200
She was hit in the back of the head
with a blunt object.

07:16.960 --> 07:17.800
CRIME SCENE PHOTO

07:17.880 --> 07:19.240
There were no witnesses at the scene,

07:19.320 --> 07:21.080
and no clues were found either.

07:26.360 --> 07:27.600
THIS WOMAN'S NAME IS ZHAO HONGMEI

07:47.720 --> 07:50.880
The patient was struck in the head
with a blunt object,

07:50.960 --> 07:52.800
causing multiple brain bleeds.

07:53.320 --> 07:56.400
Even if she survives,
the aftereffects will be severe.

07:56.480 --> 07:59.600
In milder cases, she may be unable
to take care of herself.

07:59.680 --> 08:02.160
In serious cases,
it could result in brain death.

08:02.240 --> 08:03.640
That's the overall situation.

08:04.280 --> 08:05.760
Alright. Thank you.

08:09.240 --> 08:13.360
Sir, does Zhao Hongmei's situation
remind you of anything?

08:18.360 --> 08:20.040
Can you tell me
what happened to your head first?

08:20.120 --> 08:21.720
Someone's trying to kill me.

08:21.800 --> 08:25.000
He wanted to smash my head
in broad daylight.

08:25.800 --> 08:27.360
You mean the same method?

08:28.160 --> 08:31.240
The attacker who assaulted
Wu Shanlong is the same person?

08:35.039 --> 08:37.159
Zhao Hongmei and Wu Shanlong's
mutual social connections

08:37.240 --> 08:39.120
are mainly linked to Hongyun Huihuang.

08:39.720 --> 08:41.280
Wu Shanlong is the second-largest
shareholder there.

08:41.360 --> 08:42.880
Should we go check it out?

08:45.520 --> 08:47.000
What is it?

08:47.800 --> 08:49.880
A lot of things line up now.

08:50.720 --> 08:52.240
Wu Shanlong isn't smart.

08:52.320 --> 08:54.280
But Zhao Hongmei is different.

08:56.440 --> 08:58.360
The money Zhao Hongmei used
to open Hongyun Huihuang

08:58.440 --> 08:59.880
was invested by Wu Shanlong.

08:59.960 --> 09:00.960
So,

09:01.560 --> 09:05.560
it's very likely that she and Wu Shanlong
ganged up to scam Song Qingsong.

09:06.840 --> 09:09.480
Do you think it's possible
that Song Qingsong's back?

09:11.440 --> 09:13.880
A wanted fugitive would only risk
coming back to the country

09:14.480 --> 09:16.360
for a serious reason.

09:16.880 --> 09:18.800
Most likely, he came back for revenge.

09:20.120 --> 09:22.000
Any clues at the scene
where Zhao Hongmei was attacked?

09:22.960 --> 09:25.800
I checked the photos taken by the station.
Nothing turned up.

09:32.480 --> 09:34.440
No clues from Zhao Hongmei's side,

09:35.320 --> 09:36.200
but there's something
on Wu Shanlong's end.

09:37.560 --> 09:38.760
Wu Shanlong?

09:39.280 --> 09:42.320
WEIYANG PUBLIC SECURITY BUREAU
NANSHAN BRANCH WEINAN POLICE STATION

09:46.280 --> 09:47.640
Officer Ran. Careful, it's hot.

09:47.720 --> 09:48.920
Thank you.

09:49.440 --> 09:51.480
-You don't have to do that.
-Officer He, have some tea.

09:54.520 --> 09:56.800
Officer He, it's been a while.

09:56.880 --> 09:57.840
You've put on some weight.

09:57.920 --> 09:58.920
JUSTICE FOR UNPAID WAGES
DUTIFUL AND RIGHTEOUS

09:59.000 --> 09:59.880
Happy weight.

10:01.520 --> 10:02.800
Officer He, Officer Ran.

10:02.880 --> 10:05.480
This is the evidence Wu Shanlong
brought in when he filed the report.

10:09.240 --> 10:10.400
PROPERTY OF EVIDENCE

10:19.800 --> 10:23.480
WEIYANG BUS STATION

10:23.560 --> 10:25.600
WEIYANG BUS GROUP

10:36.440 --> 10:39.680
Never seen it. We don't
have wrenches like that here.

10:39.760 --> 10:41.120
SKILLED AND TRUE, FAST AND FAIR

10:44.040 --> 10:45.240
Thank you.

10:52.200 --> 10:53.200
Excuse me.

10:53.720 --> 10:54.720
Please take a look.

10:54.800 --> 10:56.360
Have you seen a wrench like this before?

11:02.840 --> 11:04.520
WEIYANG BUS STATION

11:05.560 --> 11:07.120
Isn't this the tool
the unit used to issue to everyone

11:07.200 --> 11:08.760
when we first started working?

11:11.040 --> 11:12.120
You're right.

11:12.200 --> 11:14.600
A couple of years ago,
the fleet was merged into the company.

11:14.680 --> 11:16.600
That whole batch of tools
was phased out at once.

11:17.880 --> 11:18.680
Where did they end up?

11:18.760 --> 11:22.040
RECYCLE

11:24.360 --> 11:26.360
Excuse me. Is your boss in?

11:26.440 --> 11:28.440
-Inside.
-Thank you.

11:32.440 --> 11:33.600
This should be the place.

11:36.160 --> 11:38.720
Excuse me, sir.
I need to ask you something.

11:40.600 --> 11:42.120
Have you seen this wrench before?

11:43.160 --> 11:44.000
No.

11:49.200 --> 11:51.320
-Have you seen this person?
-No.

11:56.520 --> 11:57.760
POLICE RAN FANGXU

12:00.200 --> 12:01.680
I'm a law-abiding citizen.

12:01.760 --> 12:03.600
Everything I do is above board.

12:09.240 --> 12:11.360
Above board, eh?

12:12.400 --> 12:14.680
Above board.

12:31.680 --> 12:32.840
Above board.

12:33.360 --> 12:35.520
IRON CASTING

12:36.120 --> 12:38.560
Officer, I honestly
have no idea about this.

12:38.640 --> 12:41.120
It must've been one of my workers
who bought it without thinking.

12:41.200 --> 12:43.320
I'll contact the city management team
right away and return it to the owner.

12:46.640 --> 12:48.320
Do you recognize this man now?

12:49.480 --> 12:51.400
Looks a bit like the one
from the cement factory.

12:51.480 --> 12:52.960
Song Qingsong.

12:54.000 --> 12:56.440
But too many people come and go here.

12:56.520 --> 12:58.920
After all this time,
I really can't remember.

13:00.520 --> 13:01.640
Over here!

13:01.720 --> 13:02.800
Sir!

13:04.320 --> 13:05.160
Sir!

13:05.240 --> 13:06.800
Help!

13:07.520 --> 13:09.320
Ran! What happened?

13:09.400 --> 13:11.080
Pull me up!

13:11.160 --> 13:13.560
Ran, what were you doing up there?

13:14.960 --> 13:16.760
-What happened?
-Sir!

13:16.840 --> 13:17.960
Pull me up!

13:18.040 --> 13:19.160
How did this happen?

13:22.160 --> 13:24.520
-Why did you climb up here?
-I got stuck.

13:25.880 --> 13:26.880
That's dangerous.

13:27.960 --> 13:29.400
I got stuck right here.

13:35.360 --> 13:36.440
Are you alright?

13:38.280 --> 13:40.040
What are you holding?

13:42.160 --> 13:43.560
Here.

13:44.080 --> 13:45.800
-What is this?
-Look here.

13:48.120 --> 13:49.560
QINGSONG CEMENT

14:27.040 --> 14:28.000
What's wrong?

14:28.680 --> 14:30.320
Missing Ran?

14:35.160 --> 14:37.080
There are so many people in the force,

14:37.800 --> 14:39.360
but he's still the one
everyone respects most.

14:41.680 --> 14:44.800
If he were here, this case
would've been solved by now.

14:49.200 --> 14:51.760
He's not all-knowing.

14:51.840 --> 14:56.480
He made mistakes on his first case too
and failed as well.

14:59.800 --> 15:02.040
Hopefully, my first case…

15:02.760 --> 15:05.400
Mr. He, we found a syringe
by the roadside.

15:24.280 --> 15:26.360
Han Zi'ang had two needle marks
on his arm.

15:27.800 --> 15:31.240
Could it be he was drugged
in the internet café and dragged out,

15:31.840 --> 15:33.000
then woke up from the bumps
while on the platform truck?

15:33.080 --> 15:35.040
So the trafficker gave him another shot.

15:36.200 --> 15:37.480
But he kept struggling,

15:37.560 --> 15:39.880
and the syringe
got knocked loose and fell here.

15:40.480 --> 15:42.400
The trafficker was afraid
he would cry for help,

15:42.480 --> 15:43.640
so they knocked him out.

15:43.720 --> 15:45.680
That's how Han Zi'ang
got the injury on his head.

15:46.720 --> 15:49.400
But Han Zi'ang was found
inside New York Block.

15:49.480 --> 15:50.600
How do we explain that?

15:51.920 --> 15:53.880
Why would the trafficker
use a platform truck

15:53.960 --> 15:55.560
to drag him that far?

15:57.760 --> 16:01.160
Because the underground garage has stairs
leading to B1 of New York Block.

16:01.240 --> 16:02.480
The platform truck couldn't go up.

16:16.360 --> 16:18.440
This road goes straight
to the main gate of Yuanlongli.

16:18.960 --> 16:21.920
Han Zi'ang was brought back
into Yuanlongli.

16:26.040 --> 16:29.720
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

16:39.240 --> 16:41.120
No need to ask.
Those cameras broke long ago.

17:15.720 --> 17:17.200
On the day Han Zi'ang injured a man,

17:17.800 --> 17:19.359
no one pulling a platform truck was seen.

17:22.119 --> 17:23.359
Check the day before.

17:34.080 --> 17:35.040
Hold on.

17:36.080 --> 17:38.080
This person is a resident here.

17:39.040 --> 17:40.280
Wearing a cap.

17:40.360 --> 17:41.360
Can't see the face clearly.

17:53.840 --> 17:54.800
Mister.

17:54.880 --> 17:55.720
POLICE

17:55.800 --> 17:57.880
Your wound is serious.
Come with me and get it treated, alright?

17:58.920 --> 18:00.440
Can you hear me?

18:01.000 --> 18:02.000
Mister?

19:41.920 --> 19:43.000
Wait.

19:43.840 --> 19:47.920
The layout for No. 16
should have another room.

20:16.640 --> 20:17.720
Careful!

20:19.560 --> 20:21.280
They're a bit triggered right now.

20:26.160 --> 20:27.320
Hush.

20:31.760 --> 20:33.160
Ponies,

20:33.760 --> 20:35.000
Dad is home.

20:53.000 --> 20:54.760
POLICE

20:56.880 --> 20:57.800
How are things?

20:57.880 --> 20:59.120
Initial diagnosis says they're fine.

20:59.200 --> 21:00.360
We'll take them to the hospital now.

21:00.440 --> 21:01.560
Alright.

21:04.640 --> 21:05.480
Get him in the car.

21:10.080 --> 21:11.040
Captain Qu.

21:11.120 --> 21:12.680
-Captain Qu.
-Bai, Hui.

21:13.200 --> 21:15.240
You two did a great job.

21:15.840 --> 21:16.680
No.

21:16.760 --> 21:18.440
-We were just backing them up.
-Right.

21:18.520 --> 21:21.360
The credit should go to Mr. He, Xiaohe
and Zhong who were guiding us.

21:22.000 --> 21:23.880
The real credit goes to you young people.

21:24.680 --> 21:27.880
Old folks shouldn't be stuck in old ways.

21:27.960 --> 21:29.880
We should trust the younger generation

21:29.960 --> 21:32.200
and give them a chance to shine.

21:32.280 --> 21:35.400
Back then, Ran was just a fresh graduate.

21:35.480 --> 21:38.480
As his mentor, I gave him
full trust and support.

21:39.080 --> 21:40.040
You've got that backward, haven't you?

21:40.120 --> 21:42.200
Who was supporting whom?

21:42.280 --> 21:43.480
Qu Dahai,

21:44.120 --> 21:46.920
forget everyone else, just between us two,

21:47.000 --> 21:50.600
who's better at cracking big cases
is pretty obvious, right?

21:52.000 --> 21:54.000
Isn't everything you know
learned from Captain Ran?

21:56.080 --> 21:57.600
Come on. I'm treating you all
to some good food.

21:57.680 --> 21:59.640
-Alright.
-Thank you, Mr. He.

22:44.440 --> 22:48.200
CAROUSEL'S DEAD HEAT

23:51.880 --> 23:52.920
Keyboard,

23:54.200 --> 23:58.040
you're surely going to become
the best keyboard player.

24:24.040 --> 24:25.160
Peng Dachuang.

24:25.760 --> 24:27.240
The facts are clear,

24:28.200 --> 24:30.240
and the chain of evidence
is complete. I advise you…

24:30.320 --> 24:31.960
Can I have a cigarette?

24:45.920 --> 24:49.800
-I advise you…
-You attacked police officers.

24:49.880 --> 24:51.920
-That adds another charge.
-Behave yourself.

24:56.240 --> 24:57.120
Are you alright?

25:02.520 --> 25:03.560
Captain Qu.

25:07.720 --> 25:09.120
Get your wound treated.

25:10.920 --> 25:12.640
-What is it?
-Captain Qu,

25:12.720 --> 25:13.920
can I try?

25:15.680 --> 25:16.520
Have you interrogated a suspect before?

25:18.480 --> 25:19.800
No.

25:19.880 --> 25:22.320
But I'm good friends
with Peng Dachuang's son.

25:30.240 --> 25:31.560
You have half an hour.

25:36.720 --> 25:37.960
We'll be waiting next door.

25:38.040 --> 25:39.640
If anything happens, wave to us.

25:40.480 --> 25:41.320
Okay.

25:54.160 --> 25:55.360
-Get lost!
-I'm here.

25:55.440 --> 25:56.520
I'm here.

25:57.720 --> 25:58.960
Why are you so slow with homework?

25:59.040 --> 26:00.480
We already came up with hundreds of names.

26:00.560 --> 26:03.080
I thought of one.
Let's call it Carousel Band.

26:03.160 --> 26:04.320
Isn't it cool?

26:05.080 --> 26:06.960
Are you advertising your dad's bar?

26:07.040 --> 26:10.880
Everyone knows your dad's bar
is called Carousel's Dead Heat.

26:10.960 --> 26:13.640
Then do you know
why my dad's bar is called Carousel?

26:14.680 --> 26:17.200
Because my nickname is Pony.

26:17.280 --> 26:20.480
My dad named the bar that
because he knew I loved carousels.

26:20.560 --> 26:23.200
I don't believe it. He's so harsh on you.

26:23.280 --> 26:24.480
Pony?

26:25.320 --> 26:26.600
Pony?

26:26.680 --> 26:27.880
Pony…

27:11.560 --> 27:15.000
Peng Dachuang, why did you kidnap
those children?

27:24.440 --> 27:25.560
Was it because of…

27:26.440 --> 27:27.280
Pony?

27:28.040 --> 27:29.160
CAROUSEL'S DEAD HEAT

27:58.080 --> 27:59.520
Pony…

28:01.400 --> 28:03.200
Pony…

28:06.920 --> 28:09.040
My Pony…

28:09.960 --> 28:12.480
Pony…

28:15.120 --> 28:17.520
The ambulance is here! Make way! Hurry!

28:17.600 --> 28:18.920
What happened?

28:19.000 --> 28:20.360
What happened here?

28:21.640 --> 28:23.760
-Sir, step back.
-Back up a little.

28:23.840 --> 28:26.200
-Sir. Sir.
-Sir.

28:26.280 --> 28:28.680
Get lost!

28:28.760 --> 28:30.640
Get lost!

28:32.160 --> 28:35.120
Pony…

28:36.600 --> 28:37.720
Mr. Peng,

28:38.800 --> 28:41.800
the girl next to Pony in this photo is me.

28:44.200 --> 28:46.480
Pony was my best friend.

28:46.560 --> 28:49.080
I understand your pain.

28:49.160 --> 28:51.240
I'm sorry that he died.

28:51.320 --> 28:53.720
Who told you he's dead?
Who told you he's dead?

28:53.800 --> 28:55.680
I see him every day.

28:55.760 --> 28:57.480
I see him every day.

28:57.560 --> 29:01.360
-Dad, I'm hiding now.
-I'm coming to catch you.

29:05.440 --> 29:06.520
Pony,

29:06.600 --> 29:08.360
-found you.
-Dad!

29:08.440 --> 29:09.680
What are you doing?

29:13.920 --> 29:16.800
Those ponies are naughty.
They never want to come home.

29:30.680 --> 29:33.920
Later… Later, they told me

29:34.000 --> 29:36.640
Yuanlongli was going to be demolished
and told me to move out.

29:46.000 --> 29:46.960
DEMOLITION

29:48.040 --> 29:49.520
If I moved away,

29:50.640 --> 29:52.160
how would Pony find his way home?

30:32.960 --> 30:34.080
Who are you looking for?

30:37.680 --> 30:39.520
Is someone in your house beating a child?

30:40.120 --> 30:41.200
There's no child in my house.

30:45.520 --> 30:46.440
What are you up to?

30:47.200 --> 30:48.200
It's in your house.

30:50.400 --> 30:52.480
Are you insane?

30:54.840 --> 30:56.240
Get out of here.

30:56.840 --> 30:58.800
I'm calling the police. Leave now.

31:05.840 --> 31:07.240
Move aside!

31:14.280 --> 31:17.280
Please. Please. Please.

31:17.360 --> 31:18.560
It's not what you think.

31:18.640 --> 31:20.360
I'll send him home right now.

31:20.440 --> 31:22.080
As if I'd believe you.

31:22.160 --> 31:23.560
You're a trafficker.

31:23.640 --> 31:24.880
Weren't you going to call the police?

31:24.960 --> 31:26.800
Fine. I'll call right now.

31:26.880 --> 31:28.400
Please. Don't call the police.

31:28.480 --> 31:29.240
-Get off.
-Don't call the police.

31:32.440 --> 31:33.840
Boy, don't be scared.

31:33.920 --> 31:34.880
I'll get you out of here.

31:35.560 --> 31:38.240
Don't be scared.
I'll take you home right now.

31:40.800 --> 31:42.200
Don't be scared.

32:08.040 --> 32:10.440
Help! Help!

32:10.520 --> 32:12.080
Help!

32:12.680 --> 32:14.560
Help… Help…

32:56.160 --> 32:57.280
Hang in there.

32:58.440 --> 32:59.640
I know it hurts.

32:59.720 --> 33:00.800
Hang in there.

33:04.760 --> 33:07.320
Come. Let me untie the rope for you.

33:12.120 --> 33:13.400
Does it hurt?

33:15.720 --> 33:17.080
Human traffickers deserve to die.

33:17.160 --> 33:18.000
They deserve to die.

33:18.080 --> 33:20.200
They all deserve to die.
They all deserve to die.

33:20.280 --> 33:24.000
Why did that boy
go to your house afterward?

33:35.760 --> 33:37.680
Pony told me

33:38.760 --> 33:41.200
his parents fought every day.

33:42.480 --> 33:43.800
He didn't want to go home.

33:45.200 --> 33:48.040
QINGSONG CEMENT FACTORY, WEIYANG CITY

34:05.200 --> 34:07.440
CEMENT FACTORY
PAY UP, DEBT MUST BE PAID

34:07.520 --> 34:08.480
Do you have a saw in your car?

34:18.360 --> 34:24.639
QINGSONG CEMENT FACTORY, WEIYANG CITY

34:26.120 --> 34:27.239
Can you do this?

34:27.320 --> 34:30.040
-If not, come down.
-I'm fine.

34:31.880 --> 34:33.480
Sir. Over here.

34:35.199 --> 34:36.560
What's going on?

34:37.639 --> 34:38.960
I can't free up a hand.

34:43.400 --> 34:44.639
Hold the bag for me.

34:53.480 --> 34:54.520
Let's split up and search.

34:54.600 --> 34:56.239
-You go that side. I'll go this side.
-Alright.

36:00.360 --> 36:01.200
How is it?

36:02.360 --> 36:04.240
-Nothing on my side.
-Same here.

36:06.320 --> 36:07.720
Let's check over there.

36:09.880 --> 36:11.080
Wait.

36:15.720 --> 36:18.320
QINGSONG CEMENT

36:18.400 --> 36:20.120
Why is smoke coming from up there?

36:22.840 --> 36:23.840
Let's go check it out.

36:25.320 --> 36:26.560
Careful, sir.

36:28.120 --> 36:29.800
Slow down.

36:31.160 --> 36:32.920
-Sir.
-It's pitch black.

36:33.000 --> 36:35.760
Climbing stairs is good
for your three highs.

36:35.840 --> 36:37.000
As if.

36:37.560 --> 36:38.920
Slow down.

36:40.720 --> 36:42.880
Climbing stairs helps lose belly fat.

36:43.400 --> 36:45.320
I have no belly fat.

36:45.400 --> 36:47.760
When I was young,
my waist was slimmer than yours.

37:06.120 --> 37:07.760
Sir.

37:31.800 --> 37:32.840
Song Qingsong.

37:36.400 --> 37:37.920
Long time no see, officers.

37:39.240 --> 37:41.320
Why are you back in Weiyang?

37:49.520 --> 37:51.680
Have a seat. Let's sit and talk.

37:54.000 --> 37:56.200
I haven't met anyone since I've been here.

38:00.240 --> 38:02.240
You want to ask about
Xu Meng and her father, right?

38:02.320 --> 38:04.560
And Wu Shanlong and Zhao Hongmei.

38:06.720 --> 38:07.680
Let's do it one by one.

38:09.200 --> 38:11.440
About that young woman
at the foot massage shop,

38:12.040 --> 38:14.160
it's true I paid Wu Shanlong
to get rid of her.

38:16.520 --> 38:18.280
Back then, Wu Shanlong told me

38:18.360 --> 38:21.160
Cripple Du had someone
snatch the body away.

38:22.360 --> 38:26.440
That scoundrel knew
Cripple Du and me were enemies.

38:27.040 --> 38:28.640
But the world is small.

38:29.160 --> 38:31.320
I ran into him when I was overseas.

38:32.200 --> 38:33.920
He had fled too.

38:37.360 --> 38:39.440
Where is Xu Meng's body?

38:41.280 --> 38:43.840
Wu Shanlong was a coward.

38:44.440 --> 38:46.560
He took photos.
He definitely destroyed them.

38:47.720 --> 38:50.080
Why did you go after Zhao Hongmei?

38:51.560 --> 38:53.000
That wretched woman

38:53.080 --> 38:55.680
ganged up with Wu Shanlong
and swindled me out of my money.

38:55.760 --> 38:58.720
I worked half my life
to build that factory.

38:58.800 --> 39:00.360
The pair of them ruined it.

39:00.440 --> 39:02.440
On top of that, they owed
the workers a lot of money.

39:02.520 --> 39:04.720
Those who had followed me
for over 20 years

39:04.800 --> 39:06.960
couldn't even afford medical treatment.

39:09.760 --> 39:12.000
That's why you assaulted Wu Shanlong too?

39:13.080 --> 39:14.720
What I regret most is going soft

39:17.000 --> 39:19.120
and not killing him.

39:47.000 --> 39:48.040
Song,

39:49.800 --> 39:51.920
life hasn't been easy for you
these past years, has it?

39:56.640 --> 39:58.480
When I first ran off,

39:59.360 --> 40:02.640
I thought about bringing
my wife and child over.

40:03.160 --> 40:04.960
But I couldn't reach them at all.

40:05.720 --> 40:07.240
Later, I found out

40:07.760 --> 40:11.560
that woman had already sold the house
and run off with my child.

40:19.160 --> 40:20.640
The money I took with me

40:21.800 --> 40:23.360
was gone in less than two years.

40:24.640 --> 40:27.440
I couldn't speak their language,
and I was undocumented.

40:28.320 --> 40:30.440
I could only do construction work
and make very little money.

40:33.280 --> 40:34.880
You would never guess it.

40:35.400 --> 40:36.400
In the end,

40:37.160 --> 40:39.280
it was Cripple Du who gave me money,

40:39.800 --> 40:42.120
so I could sneak back here
and get my revenge.

40:48.400 --> 40:52.000
We had been enemies half our lives,
but he actually gave me money.

40:54.880 --> 40:56.120
As for what I owed the workers,

40:57.080 --> 40:59.760
I sold components from the factory
to pay them back.

41:00.600 --> 41:03.240
Now my revenge is done.
I don't care about anything anymore.

41:04.400 --> 41:07.480
I admit everything I did.

41:08.920 --> 41:09.960
Come on.

41:22.000 --> 41:22.920
We'll do that after we go downstairs.

41:25.200 --> 41:26.600
Give me a moment to tidy up.

41:49.360 --> 41:50.360
Thank you.
